{"id":49104,"imdb":"tt0115895","en":"Chronicle of a Disappearance","orig":"سجل اختفاء","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"Chronicle of a Disappearance unfolds in a series of seemingly unconnected cinematic tableaux, each of them focused on incidents or characters which seldom reappear later in the film. Among the many unrelated scenes, there is a Palestinian actress struggling to find an apartment in West Jerusalem, the owner of the Holy Land souvenir shop preparing merchandise for incoming Japanese tourists, a group of old women gossiping about their relatives, and an Israeli police van which screeches to a halt so several heavily armed soldiers can get off the car and urinate.","rd":"1996-09-01","rt":88,"g":[18],"lang":"ar","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Dhat Productions","logo":null,"c":"PS"},{"n":"Les Ateliers de l'Arche","logo":null,"c":"FR"},{"n":"ZDF","logo":"/otZHbf1HmzLRQsZFSqJXkf8EHz7.png","c":"DE"},{"n":"Das kleine Fernsehspiel","logo":"/9l53h4TYA8ptXcM4JPDabycZO4v.png","c":"DE"},{"n":"Hubert Bals Fund","logo":"/eUVeNogxsgzL78KU5ugDvea2Cet.png","c":"NL"}],"countries":["FR","DE","IL","PS"],"langs":["Arabic","English","French","Hebrew","Russian"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"FR","d":"1996-09-01"},{"c":"IT","d":"1996-09-01"},{"c":"US","d":"1997-01-20"},{"c":"SE","d":"1997-01-31"}],"dir":["Elia Suleiman"],"prod":["Elia Suleiman"],"wri":["Elia Suleiman"],"mus":["Abed Azrie"],"dop":["Marc-André Batigne"],"cast":[{"n":"Elia Suleiman","ch":"E.S.","p":"/gIy5QcL9ShxnHecTpCY699nm92A.jpg"},{"n":"Nazira Suleiman","ch":"Mother","p":null},{"n":"Fuad Suleiman","ch":"Father","p":null},{"n":"Ali Suliman","ch":"The Man","p":"/fG9V68oshqkuDSSRkLZdCci6z1Q.jpg"},{"n":"Juliet Mazzawi","ch":"The aunt","p":null},{"n":"Fawaz Eilemi","ch":"Abu Adnan","p":null},{"n":"Leonid Alexeenko","ch":"Priest","p":null},{"n":"Ula Tabari","ch":"Adan","p":"/cmQw5d32F6XByqRvcaWb8ehRk8d.jpg"},{"n":"Taha Mouhamad Ali","ch":"The writer","p":null},{"n":"Samer Azar","ch":"Turban man","p":null},{"n":"Imil